                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino tulizi kuti makani oonse nguwaamba Mulao, mbaabo bali muMulao mbuwaambila, kuti milomo yoonse isinkwe, alimwi kuti nyika yoonse ibe amulandu kumeso aa-Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
